2026-11-09T18:57:02.7738985Z ✔ native handoff origin checks work on any exact server origin and reject cross-site browser traffic (154.481571ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.7799032Z ✔ the OAuth callback is a base-path-free API path (7.501047ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.7908545Z ✔ the loopback callback is carried through the return path (0.227357ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8020267Z ✔ only an unadorned loopback callback is accepted (2.415844ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8148594Z ✔ the desktop state must be URL-safe and bounded (0.269359ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8230355Z ✔ the OAuth callback URL is absolute and keeps the base path (0.79851ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8273581Z ✔ challenge, verifier and code shapes are bounded (11.230575ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8383047Z ✔ the browser starts the provider the app asked for, and never hands over a web session unseen (1.093547ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8492086Z ✔ discovery matches the desktop contract without a login or provider credentials (169.798317ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8505748Z ✔ only configured sign-in methods and effective mobile trust are advertised (0.836024ms)
