2026-11-09T18:57:02.8536415Z ✔ version negotiation preserves the fixed update error and still returns server capabilities (2.665995ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8538385Z ✔ RPC never authenticates a cookie-only, revoked, invalid or delegated token (13.035333ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8540376Z ✔ authenticated bearer wins over foreign cookies and the original action sees its real session (7.286752ms)
2026-11-09T18:57:02.8542244Z ✔ parallel users retain separate request scopes and original tenant checks (4.887216ms)
